# Never sent to Vercel as source when deploying from this machine (CLI).
# A second line of defence, not the first: a public build also stops if any of
# this is in the tree it builds (next.config.ts), and Git never holds it.

# Reference copies of cover artwork: private, not licensed.
public/covers/

# Local builds. The private one refers to the reference copies and its image
# cache holds reduced copies of them; neither is ever uploaded.
.next/
.next-public/
